* text=auto eol=lf
*.cs        text diff=csharp
*.ps1       text eol=crlf
*.csproj    text
*.md        text
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.bin       binary
*.gz        binary

# Named rather than left to auto-detection. `text=auto` guesses from the first
# few kilobytes, and the one it is most likely to get wrong is the mesh blob:
# it opens with an eight-byte header and floats, which is exactly the sort of
# thing a heuristic can read as text and then quietly rewrite the line endings
# inside.
*.wav       binary
*.glb       binary
*.fbx       binary
*.blend     binary
*.mesh      binary
*.mp4       binary
*.webp      binary
